# session: TAF_Cosine_Ci_20261118

## how to reproduce
Mounts: <folder-with-ROOT> is the extracted session folder (the one containing ROOT and the .thy files),
mounted at /k; <AFP>/thys is the thys/ folder of the Archive of Formal Proofs, mounted read-only at /afp
(the session needs only HOL-Analysis, HOL-Probability and HOL-Decision_Procs, so an empty folder also works);
isabelle_home is a docker volume for the heap images. <settings-file> is an Isabelle settings file with the two lines ML_OPTIONS32="--minheap 500 --maxheap 1800 --enablegcsharing" and ML_OPTIONS64="--minheap 500 --maxheap 1800 --enablegcsharing" (the ML heap limits), mounted over /home/isabelle/.isabelle/etc/settings.
Without the settings file the default ML heap is used (the build needs a few GB of memory).

